---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="About"
	description="Annabel paints figures drawn from feminine archetypes and dreams, in acrylic on canvas, in Fort Lauderdale."
>
	<div class="mx-auto max-w-site px-5 py-16 sm:px-12 sm:py-24">
		<h1 class="font-display text-[32px] font-light leading-[1.1] text-ink sm:text-[48px]">
			About
		</h1>

		<div class="mt-12 grid gap-10 sm:mt-16 sm:grid-cols-[minmax(0,360px)_1fr] sm:gap-16">
			<!-- PLACEHOLDER: replace with Annabel's portrait.
			     Per BRAND.md: natural indirect light, no filters. -->
			<div
				class="flex aspect-[4/5] w-full items-center justify-center border border-dashed border-mist text-sm text-stone"
			>
				Portrait of Annabel goes here
			</div>

			<div>
				<p class="max-w-prose text-charcoal">
					Annabel has painted since she was a child. Her work draws on feminine archetypes
					and the images that surface in her dreams, translated into acrylic on canvas.
				</p>

				<p class="mt-5 max-w-prose text-charcoal">
					She paints figures that feel familiar and slightly out of place — fragments of one
					interior life, made to fit into someone else&rsquo;s. She lives and paints in Fort
					Lauderdale, and credits her fianc&eacute; with pushing her to take the work
					seriously.
				</p>

				<div class="mt-10 flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row sm:gap-4">
					<a class="btn" href="/originals">Shop originals</a>
					<a class="btn-secondary" href="/commissions">Request a commission</a>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</Layout>
